      "body": "Update the development/CI base image from `nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch:26.09-py3` to `nvcr.io/nvidian/nemo:fw-base-26.12.rc0`, following https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/8849.\n\n- Change the Dockerfile's default base image.\n- Add SHA-pinned NGC login for CI builds and main-branch dependency updates, with the two NGC secrets forwarded through the dependency-update caller.\n\nCI uses the Dockerfile default. Existing build arguments, the install-test image, documentation, Python dependency pins, and release branches remain unchanged.\n\nValidation:\n- Registry manifest inspection confirms amd64 and arm64; index digest: `sha256:9372ae5aa202b7761d28f5252549ffbb3fce0dbc497cd845a2624ef152a51c7d`.\n- The amd64 base container starts and imports PyTorch.\n- Changed YAML files parse; `git diff --check` passes.\n- `uv run pre-commit run --all-files` passes inside the target base container.\n- Docker dependency-layer checks passed during initial validation.\n- Full Bridge builds and GPU tests are pending CI (`needs-more-tests` and `full-test-suite` applied).\n\n`NGC_API_USER` and `NGC_API_KEY` are configured as repository Actions secrets.\n\nQuarantined tests: none.\n",
